{"title":"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/c/5acbb551f5261172a8b4c7be1bbfbd35fb72aebb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = ax^4 - bx^2 + x + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"198\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/8/3d8df01006ab1f46b6ffa34fe79f0eaafc880e1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f( - 3) = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"81\" height=\"18\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/c/dbca9923a27f447c39a41dd8f18288110a363e30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(3) =$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"55\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/b/f0bf79b339d027017a36d8fa9b8d06704f5fb804.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ -5 } \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ -2 } \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ 1 } \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ 3 } \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ 8 }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"386\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/d/07dd1c816989b8d5fa03a874911c0a9171408363.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(-x) = a(-x)^4 - b(-x)^2 - x + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"269\" height=\"19\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/5/9858907a312bc34422331727c4d610753083e0a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(-x) = ax^4 - bx^2 - x + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"212\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/1/31196213d76b88e5b57b6f89262f6e4a7f893650.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(-x) = (ax^4 - bx^2 + x + 5) - 2x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"268\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/1/a81fdec1974e906bb5ceb799e04486da3fa23b0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(-x) =  f(x) - 2x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"153\" height=\"20\" />. \n</p><p>Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/17407da2c5fa8f2646b2dd883e6ca1271f79f84d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(3) = f(-3)-2(-3) = 8 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{(E)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"262\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/3/36398f05dab4348ce8af869a475a4b57d8469c43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(-3) = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"81\" height=\"18\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/6/a36d26672751f2b6dd4ee664dfaf787c146aa8ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$81a - 9b + -3 + 5 = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"179\" height=\"16\" />.  Simplifying, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/a/15a8e035b08816ed310b17a438a06d64bc5c716c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$81a - 9b = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"99\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>Getting an expression for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/3/003fdb0d6edace39b9ce3789476864e120619656.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" />, we find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/3/ef3d5274974add26d39701a6bdcad9c4e9b5af51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(3) = 81a - 9b + 3 + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"187\" height=\"18\" />.  Since the first two terms sum up to zero, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/e/50e11ec54a0312df9e4e86bc2c271beb24e59876.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(3) = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" />, which is answer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/3/3a3faf1572d785ef1d5d72f120fb3a16190b4b61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(E)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"25\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/f/c6ff35f9d605211aaffac6cca22719cfb090d91c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -3$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />, we get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/6/94649732be3c30ed54cd54f237243708f0d46560.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(-3) = 81a - 9b - 3 + 5 = 81a - 9b + 2.\\]\" width=\"327\" height=\"18\" />\nBut <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/3/36398f05dab4348ce8af869a475a4b57d8469c43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(-3) = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"81\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/3/0d3a17aee3bc7254c497ea1694e4ce9c93653306.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$81a - 9b + 2 = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"131\" height=\"14\" />, which means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/a/15a8e035b08816ed310b17a438a06d64bc5c716c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$81a - 9b = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"99\" height=\"13\" />. Then\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/f/d5fb2743b8131ca65b52f588d6580eb2969e44e3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(3) = 81a - 9b + 3 + 5 = 0 + 3 + 5 = \\boxed{8}.\\]\" width=\"331\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME\" title=\"1995 AHSME\">1995 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1995 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1995\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1995 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\